          <svg class="drive-logo" viewBox="0 0 87.3 78" width="40" height="36" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6.6 66.85 3.85 6.65c.8 1.4 1.95 2.5 3.3 3.3l13.75-23.8h-27.5c0 1.55.4 3.1 1.2 4.5z" fill="#0066da"/><path d="m43.65 25-13.75-23.8c-1.35.8-2.5 1.9-3.3 3.3l-25.4 44a9.06 9.06 0 0 0 -1.2 4.5h27.5z" fill="#00ac47"/><path d="m73.55 76.8c1.35-.8 2.5-1.9 3.3-3.3l1.6-2.75 7.65-13.25c.8-1.4 1.2-2.95 1.2-4.5h-27.502l5.852 11.5z" fill="#ea4335"/><path d="m43.65 25 13.75-23.8c-1.35-.8-2.9-1.2-4.5-1.2h-18.5c-1.6 0-3.15.45-4.5 1.2z" fill="#00832d"/><path d="m59.8 53h-32.3l-13.75 23.8c1.35.8 2.9 1.2 4.5 1.2h50.8c1.6 0 3.15-.45 4.5-1.2z" fill="#2684fc"/><path d="m73.4 26.5-12.7-22c-.8-1.4-1.95-2.5-3.3-3.3l-13.75 23.8 16.15 28h27.45c0-1.55-.4-3.1-1.2-4.5z" fill="#ffba00"/></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 id="driveTitle">Respaldo en Google Drive</h2>
            <p>Tus cotizaciones a salvo y en todos tus equipos</p>
          </div>
          <button id="driveClose" class="icon-only modal-x" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button>
        </div>
        <p id="driveStatus" class="drive-status"></p>
        <ul class="drive-points">
          <li>Cada vez que guardas, se actualiza el archivo <b>cotizador-respaldo.json</b> en la carpeta <b>Cotizador</b> de tu Drive.</li>
          <li>En otro equipo, conecta la misma cuenta y trae tus cotizaciones.</li>
